# Tauri

- Keep network access scoped in `capabilities/default.json`.
- Only allow local Hermes/Ollama/debug dashboard URLs unless requirements change.
- Prefer frontend HTTP via the Tauri HTTP plugin when webview CORS is insufficient.
- Do not widen filesystem or shell permissions without documenting why in `docs/`.
